A single general lemma capturing the recurrence

  partitionCount n  =  − ∑_{k = 0}^{n − 1} partitionCount k · pentagonalSign (n − k)
                       (for `n ≥ 1`, integer form)

extracted from `(partitionGenFun ℤ) · (qPochInfPS ℤ) = 1` at coefficient
